35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,It seems some rooms are naturally colder and others use far more power. A flat split feels illogical given these disparities.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,"I saw how other houses do it, and honestly, the paperwork looks like a nightmare. It takes so much time!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The payment logs confirm that disputes over changing amounts are causing delays. Some people are definitely paying more than others.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The bills swing wildly between summer and winter. Also, installing meters would be quite expensive per room.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,The kitchen notice showed that people are already avoiding using appliances because they're afraid of the cost.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, if the cost is high, maybe we can't do meters. But we must address the ""coat in February"" problem.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Minato, that's so sad! But if we make the system too complex, the person managing it will just be stressed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If we keep a flat split, the people in the colder rooms are unfairly penalized by the architecture.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Exactly. But a system that requires manual reconciliation every month, as @Mio found, seems unsustainable for us.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,I just want us to stop being mean to each other about the money.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,We need a system where the cost is predictable so no one feels they have to suffer in the cold.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,Maybe something where the amount stays the same for a few months?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"That would stop the monthly arguments, but does it solve the unfairness of room differences?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"It solves the predictability issue, but not the usage disparity. However, it's cheaper than the electrician's quote.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"As long as we don't have to argue every single month, I'm happy.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let's consider if we value absolute precision or peace of mind and simplicity.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,Definitely peace of mind!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I still lean toward fairness, but peace is a close second.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I prefer a balance. We can't afford a massive upfront cost, nor can I afford huge winter spikes.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,I agree with Mio. Let's keep it simple.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
