60,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"We have three options: A is a flat split, B is a seasonal fixed rate, and C is per-room metering.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A is too simple and unfair, and C sounds like too much work. I like B!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Option C is the fairest, but @Victoria mentioned the cost. Option B is a decent compromise.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option C is too expensive. Option A is too volatile. Option B provides the stability I need.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option B sounds the most peaceful. No surprises every month.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Option B removes the anxiety of flicking a switch, which is my main concern. I vote for B.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mio,,I'm definitely voting for B. It's the best for the person doing the math too.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I'll concede to B. It's better than the current tension, even if it's not perfectly precise.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Victoria,,I agree. B is the most rational choice given the budget and the bill swings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minato,,Me too! Option B!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,It seems we are in total agreement.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mio,,Yay!,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,A rare moment of complete consensus.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Victoria,,It is the most pragmatic solution.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'm glad we're all happy.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
